<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Glass Jan-Sept pretax up 45 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Glass Jan-Sept pretax up 45 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-September 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				7,756 vs 7,630</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    2,464 vs 1,942</p>
<p>    Non-operating profit		  682 vs   230</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 3,145 vs 2,171</p>
<p>    Net profit			    2,548 vs 1,831</p>
<p>NOTE - Taiwan Glass Industrial Corp is Taiwan's leading glass maker.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
